flowchart TB
  EV[Outcome events]
  EV -- success --> ST1[reinforce verified strategy]
  EV -- repeated errors --> ST2[increase caution / shorten horizon]
  EV -- task switch --> ST3[increase context refresh]
  EV -- long horizon --> ST4[increase patience / verification depth]
  ST1 --> ST[(control state<br/>bounded 0..1 scalars)]
  ST2 --> ST
  ST3 --> ST
  ST4 --> ST
  ST --> CFG[execution + verification parameters]
  CFG --> STR[Strategist]
  CFG --> EXE[Executor]
